  @ ------------------------------------------------------------
  @  GEVAll
  @  Everything about one point, tagged: CDF, PDF, CDFc, mean, deviation.
  @  Author & design          : Jean Wilson
  @  Co-authors & programming  : Claude & Claude Code (Anthropic)
  @  Arguments may be given loose or bundled in a list of 4; that list is
  @  what LastArguments reports, and its length is checked before use.
  @ ------------------------------------------------------------
  IF DUP TypeName "list" == THEN IF DUP Size 4 ≠ THEN "GEVAll: needs 4 arguments" DoError END Explode Drop END
  → x0v scv xiv Xv « x0v 0 + scv 0 + xiv 0 + Xv 0 + → x0 sc xi X « 'EXP(-IFTE(ABS(xi)<0.000000001;EXP(-(X-x0)/sc);(1+xi*(X-x0)/sc)^(-1/xi)))' →Num 'Kc' STO Kc "CDF" →Tag '(IFTE(ABS(xi)<0.000000001;EXP(-(X-x0)/sc);(1+xi*(X-x0)/sc)^(-1/xi))^(xi+1))*EXP(-IFTE(ABS(xi)<0.000000001;EXP(-(X-x0)/sc);(1+xi*(X-x0)/sc)^(-1/xi)))/sc' →Num "PDF" →Tag '1-Kc' →Num "CDFc" →Tag 'IFTE(ABS(xi)<0.000000001;x0+sc*0.5772156649015329;x0+sc*(Γ(1-xi)-1)/xi)' →Num "μ" →Tag 'IFTE(ABS(xi)<0.000000001;sc*Ⓒπ/√(6);sc*√(Γ(1-2*xi)-Γ(1-xi)^2)/ABS(xi))' →Num "sx" →Tag { Kc } PURGE x0v scv xiv Xv 4 →List Drop » »
